        "statement": "RequestAddNode promotes an existing observer only when the supplied AddNode address equals the observer's stored address. An invalid or empty target is rejected by requestConfigChange before a proposal; a different valid target is rejected by membership.isInvalidObserverPromotion. A matching address is accepted and removes the observer role.",
        "conditions": "The user-facing RequestAddNode path, the default or configured target validator, and the membership state machine are used as captured. No execution is included; the behavior is established by the source and membership tests.",
